    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "On 29.08.2024 while issuing notice of motion, the following submissions of learned counsel for petitioner were noticed:-",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 804,
      "end": 926,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "29.08.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 808,
          "end": 818
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "\"Learned counsel for the petitioner, inter alia, contends that the petitioner was an employee of de-addiction centre being operated by co-accused Vishal and Rajinder Singh.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 926,
      "end": 1098,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Vishal",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1072,
          "end": 1078
        },
        {
          "text": "Rajinder Singh",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1083,
          "end": 1097
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.15879638493061066
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "He was in no manner involved in the day to day operation of the de-addiction centre allegedly being run by the co-accused.\"",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1099,
      "end": 1222,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2507646381855011
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "Thereafter, on 11.11.2024 petitioner was granted the concession of interim bail, however, he did not join the investigation.",
