        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "learned counsel for the petitioner, this Court had granted the concession of interim bail to the petitioner and asked him to join investigation:-",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1589,
      "end": 1734,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1950000524520874
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "\"Learned counsel for the petitioner has submitted that firstly there were explicit directions of this Court that no coercive steps would be taken against the petitioner and hence, it is very strange that the police has initiated proceedings under Section 82 of the Cr.P.C/84 of BNSS against the petitioner.\"",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1735,
      "end": 2043,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 82",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1983,
          "end": 1993
        },
        {
          "text": "Cr.P.C/84",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2001,
          "end": 2010
        },
        {
          "text": "BNSS",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 2014,
          "end": 2018
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1933622509241104
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "Learned counsel for the petitioner submits that in compliance of order dated 19.02.2025, the petitioner has joined investigation and cooperated with the investigating agency.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2045,
      "end": 2219,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "19.02.2025",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2122,
          "end": 2132
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.27562782168388367
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "He, on further instructions, submits that the petitioner is not required for further investigation much less for his custodial interrogation.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2220,
      "end": 2361,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2852521240711212
    },
